.SS "int sc_v4l2_device_format (\fBsc_v4l2_device_t\fP * vd, unsigned int * width, unsigned int * height, unsigned int * bytesperline, unsigned int * sizeimage)"

.PP
Set output configuration of device\&. We demand sRGB color space with RGB 565 pixel format (2 bytes)\&. The image size values on output define the buffer size to allocate\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvd\fP Device must support the desired output format\&. 
.br
\fIwidth\fP Desired width on input, actual width on output\&. 
.br
\fIheight\fP Desired height on input, actual height on output\&. 
.br
\fIbytesperline\fP Bytes per line on output, including padding\&. 
.br
\fIsizeimage\fP Bytes per image, including padding\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
0 on success, -1 otherwise and setting errno\&. 
.RE
.PP

