.SS "int sc_v4l2_device_select (\fBsc_v4l2_device_t\fP * vd, unsigned usec)"

.PP
Call select (2) to wait for write availability of device\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvd\fP Opened \fBsc_v4l2_device_t\fP capable of output\&. 
.br
